Executive Sales & Marketing Dashboard
A 3-page Power BI dashboard built for a local Pakistani business and the numbers tell a very local story. The Sales & Revenue Summary opens with the headline: PKR 26.54M in total revenue across 250 orders, with an average order value of PKR 106.18K and PKR 4.62M in gross profit.
But the honest story sits right next to that headline 44 of those 250 orders were cancelled. A dashboard that hides that number would be lying, so this one tracks it openly. The Product & Profitability page digs into which products actually make money versus which ones only look busy, and the Customer & Regional Deep-Dive breaks performance down by city Karachi, Lahore, Islamabad, Faisalabad, and Multan and by how customers really pay: Easypaisa, JazzCash, and Cash on Delivery.
That local context is what makes this dashboard different from a generic sales report. It reflects how business actually happens in Pakistan mobile wallets and COD sitting right alongside traditional sales and treats cancellations as seriously as revenue because lost orders are lost money.
Built with Power BI, DAX, and Power Query, it turns everyday sales records into decisions a business owner can act on: what to push, where to focus, and where orders are slipping away.
